  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Requires Umbraco CMS 18.0+. This release will not install on Umbraco 17 - the 1.x line on the main branch continues to be maintained separately for Umbraco 17.\n\n- Fixed a startup crash under Umbraco 18 caused by removed Swashbuckle-era OpenAPI types; migrated to Umbraco 18's AddBackOfficeOpenApiDocument API. Fixes #1.\n- Updated all Umbraco.Cms.* package references to the 18.x line.\n- Updated the backoffice client to @umbraco-cms/backoffice 18.x.\n- Verified end-to-end against a live Umbraco 18.1.1 site: install, boot, login, and a full audit run.\n- Package versioning now tracks the Umbraco major version it targets (18.0.0, not 2.0.0).\n\nFull release notes: https://github.com/ProWorksCorporation/ProWorks.Umbraco.MediaAudit/releases/tag/v18.0.0",
